# Observation log — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

One row per **observed action**. Capture events, not summaries — the raw sequence is what reveals the loops and the dead time. Synthesis happens in `operating-map.md`, downstream.

**Ids are append-only and never reused.** A deleted row is struck through with a reason, not removed — a dangling citation is a defect you can find, a silently renumbered id is one you cannot.

**Class:** `observed` (an FDE watched it) · `system` (a log or export) · `documented` (an SOP) · `stated` (someone said so).
**Tell:** `repeat` · `paste` · `switch` · `dead` · `-`

